{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-74","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与截差无理线段与中项无理线段","englishTitle":"If from a medial straight line there be subtracted a medial straight line which is commensurable with the whole in square only, and which contains with the whole a rational rectangle, the remainder is irrational. And let it be called a first apotome of a medial straight line.","book":10,"number":74,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.74","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.74/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":74,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-74@raw-6a5f0eef5f7468b9","contentId":"euclid-10-74","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6a5f0eef5f7468b9e43106770f89a8d57ed4e6a9154e8fbb8e2398248a7f2a1a","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-74.statement","euclid-10-74.proof.1","euclid-10-74.proof.2","euclid-10-74.proof.3","euclid-10-74.proof.4","euclid-10-74.proof.5","euclid-10-74.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-74.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-74","revisionId":"euclid-10-74@raw-6a5f0eef5f7468b9","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"09cd02b9e7b1a453058d2bfd4a79f08a8f18996562355aaadbede9bf7c0be7f7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If from a medial straight line there be subtracted a medial straight line which is commensurable with the whole in square only, and which contains with the whole a rational rectangle, the remainder is irrational. And let it be called a first apotome of a medial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果从中项无理线段中减去中项无理线段,即可公度,仅以正方形计,并包含整个有理,矩形,则其余为无理。让它称为中项无理线段中的第一个截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-74.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-74","revisionId":"euclid-10-74@raw-6a5f0eef5f7468b9","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fe1a0f09c1f7996efe2951112cc4915a75997b3156f6ff78fc965caea8d854dd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For from the medial straight line AB let there be subtracted the medial straight line BC which is commensurable with AB in square only and with AB makes the rectangle AB, BC rational; I say that the remainder AC is irrational; and let it be called a first apotome of a medial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从中项无理线段 AB中减去中项无理线段 BC,即可公度,AB,正方形,AB,矩形 AB,BC 有理;我说其余的AC是无理;把它称为中项无理线段中的第一个截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-74.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-74","revisionId":"euclid-10-74@raw-6a5f0eef5f7468b9","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"74d6fd59372ed30b606220ade1410ef038a1dd593987eae6bd720f422dac3308","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AB, BC are medial, the squares on AB, BC are also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,AB,BC是中项无理线段,AB,BC也是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-74.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-74","revisionId":"euclid-10-74@raw-6a5f0eef5f7468b9","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2cccfe8980ca135f009c89bea32967cf4178f6c939f0d05416bc19999df8870a","citations":["euclid-2-7","euclid-10-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But twice the rectangle AB, BC is rational; therefore the squares on AB, BC are incommensurable with twice the rectangle AB, BC; therefore twice the rectangle AB, BC is also incommensurable with the remainder, the square on AC, [Cf. [II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)] since, if the whole is incommensurable with one of the magnitudes, the original magnitudes will also be incommensurable. [[X. 16](/principles/euclid-10-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但矩形 AB,BC是有理的两倍;因此,AB,BC是不可公度,矩形是不可公度,矩形是AB,BC的两倍;因此,矩形,AB,BC也是不可公度,其余为不可公度,AC的两倍 [Cf. [II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7) [[X. 16](/principles/euclid-10-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-74.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-74","revisionId":"euclid-10-74@raw-6a5f0eef5f7468b9","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c9663d43cb186e8118015a2d33d3c758ac92b5e63a9fd86afeb9a9f293dad492","citations":["euclid-10-def-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But twice the rectangle AB, BC is rational; therefore the square on AC is irrational; therefore AC is irrational. [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但矩形 AB,BC是有理的两倍;因此,AC的正方形是无理;AC是无理。 [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-74.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-74","revisionId":"euclid-10-74@raw-6a5f0eef5f7468b9","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9147ef79f4044cee1381cc32f0d547654e65676db14f8fa071c26eee93ed463f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And let it be called a first apotome of a medial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它被称为中项无理线段中的第一个截差无理线段"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-74.source","contentId":"euclid-10-74","revisionId":"euclid-10-74@raw-6a5f0eef5f7468b9","order":6,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ae153eeeca2e192cc839ba50fd43fe64760682b201e62f0f509c546c8f531074","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.74/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.74\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-74:euclid-2-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-74","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-74.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-2-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.74","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.74/","sourceLabel":"II. 7"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-74:euclid-10-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-74","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-74.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.74","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.74/","sourceLabel":"X. 16"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-74:euclid-10-def-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-74","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-74.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-def-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-en